 ### Contour Propagation
-Based on the continuity of the scalar field, an active "seed cell" is determined for each connected component of each possible isosurface [S1]. Seed cells are grouped by isovalue [S1]. The isosurface is traced via breadth-first traversal through face-adjacencies starting from the seed cells corresponding to the required isovalue [S1]. See [Contour Propagation Isosurfacing](1231-contour-propagation-isosurfacing.md).
